flowchart TB
  subgraph sources[Inputs — Germany demand]
    OPSD[OPSD fixed release / ENTSO-E token API]
    METEO[Open-Meteo historical weather]
    SYN[Synthetic demo — explicitly labeled]
    MQTT[Device simulator → MQTT broker]
  end
  OPSD & METEO & SYN --> ING[Acquisition + UTC normalization]
  ING --> VALID[Schema / gaps / duplicates / freshness validation]
  MQTT --> TV[Telemetry validation + QoS1 acknowledgement]
  VALID --> DB[(PostgreSQL observations)]
  TV --> TDB[(PostgreSQL telemetry — separate kW stream)]
  VALID --> RAW[(Immutable files / optional S3 snapshots)]
  DB --> FEATURES[Shared origin-safe direct 24-hour features]
  FEATURES --> TRAIN[XGBoost + weekly baseline / chronological validation]
  TRAIN --> MLFLOW[MLflow runs, artifacts, metrics and registry]
  MLFLOW --> GATE[Validation thresholds + reloaded artifact smoke test]
  GATE -->|accepted| ALIAS[Staging → champion / retain previous]
  GATE -->|rejected| RETAIN[Keep existing champion]
  ALIAS --> API[FastAPI / Docker / Kubernetes / Helm]
  API --> PRED[(PostgreSQL predictions + features)]
  API --> PROM[Prometheus / Grafana / alerts]
  PRED & DB --> QUALITY[PSI drift + delayed-label MAE / RMSE]
  QUALITY --> PROM
  QUALITY -->|quality policy| RETRAIN[Controlled retraining]
  SCHEDULE[Weekly schedule] --> RETRAIN
  RETRAIN --> FEATURES
  API -->|post-deployment check fails| ROLLBACK[Restore previous registry alias / Helm revision]
  ROLLBACK --> API
